"entity": {
"name": "Piraeus Bank S.A.",
"description": "Piraeus Bank SA engages in the provision of banking services. It operates under the following business segments: Retail Banking, Corporate Banking, Piraeus Financial Markets, and Other. The retail banking segment includes the mass, affluent, small business, international business unit, and public core customer segments. The corporate banking is comprised of corporates, shipping, SMEs, and agricultural core customers. The Piraeus financial markets covers fixed income, foreign exchange, and treasury activities. The other segment is involved in management related activities not allocated to specific customer segments. The company was founded in 1916 and is headquartered in Athens, Greece.",
